    aiContent: {
      difficulty: 'Intermediate',
      considerations: [
        'Be the last player with a running score of 100 or less; players are eliminated at 101 or more. The last survivor collects the pool (Pulle).',
        "Block game: play a tile matching an open end of the layout or pass if unable. Tableau is built in a double line (matching end on the side). After each round, add pip total of unplayed tiles to each player's running score. At 101+ a player is eliminated unless they buy back (pay half stake, score set to middle of the other three). If all have 101+ (broken pool), scores reset to zero and everyone stakes again.",
        'Four players, 7 tiles each; no boneyard.',
        'Pip total of unplayed tiles added to running score each round.',
      ],
    },
